- New and developing technicians can complete rounds more independently, freeing senior technicians for higher-value tasks.
- Bringing POL/LRT-CCD in line with other areas reduces variability and improves overall operational maturity.', '2026-01-28T00:00:00.000', '2026-01-29T16:02:52.000', N'81051447', NULL, 1);
