', N'Review and assess pressure switch alarms while running system in manual.', N'10006', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/8307.jpeg', N'226-PLC-210 Mandrel Refurb Curing Oven alarms 6, 7 and 8 only active in auto mode. These alarms will trigger if loss of air pressure in plenum of recirculation fan and two exhaust fans. They will turn off heating elements to prevent overheating of elements.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/8307.jpeg', N'Added the functionality of these alarms to manual mode. As this system runs in manual mode the alarms will have the same effect as they would in auto mode.', NULL, N'Alarms have been updated in PLC to help reliability of system and help prevent heating element over temperature events.', N'Be mindful of how equipment is being ran and how interlocking/alarming is effecting the system.', 0, NULL, N'Mitigação significativa do risco de acidente durante a calibração.
