Not good fit, vibrating loose and allowing debris to enter electrical rooms. This is not good for the sensitive electrical components.', N'Have proper filter available from inventory', N'10096', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/9045.jpeg', N'Bulkheads were left with random sizes of material used as a filter medium. This material would eventually work itself free and allow contaminated airflow into the electrical/drive rooms.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/9045.jpeg', N'Proper filter was sourced out and purchased. This item was submitted to C-H Master for item master creation. Once the material master was created, (13473962), it was submitted to Inventory control for stocking. This filter is an Aerostar Series 400  36" x 36" x 2" MERV 8 Standard Capacity Pleated Air Filter.
This is the proper size filter for the bulkhead opening thus improving air flow and minimizing contamination.', N'https://www.rsl.ca/Product/aerostar-series-400-36-x-36-x-2-merv-8-standard-capacity-pleated-air-filter-epsc36x36x2-fil', N'Proper filter improved airflow quality. Having item in inventory allowed filter change to be aligned with preventative maintenance program.', N'Proper filters improve airflow quality', 0, NULL, N'Foi identificado vazamento recorrente nas mangueiras do sistema, ocasionado pelo ressecamento precoce após intervenções de manutenção, além de falhas constantes na bomba em operação.

Essa condição impactava diretamente a segurança operacional, podendo causar acidentes, além de comprometer a eficiência do processo e gerar retrabalho.', '2026-03-07T00:00:00.000', '2026-03-30T08:51:28.000', N'81007346', NULL, NULL);
