', NULL, N'a falta do suporte para transporte, facilita riscos de acidentes ao serem manuseados e transportados na empilhadeira, tais como: prensamento de mão e dedos no manuseio.', N'Analisar e Criar acessórios ou equipamentos que proporcionem segurança a todos colaboradores.', 0, NULL, N'The expected outcome of this project is a consistent, reliable, and sustainable peer training program across all warehouse areas. New and transitioning employees are onboarded correctly and efficiently using standardized guidelines and checklists, reducing training variability, missed setup steps, and reliance on individual knowledge. This results in improved process adherence, faster learning curves, increased employee confidence, and stronger operational continuity despite turnover or staffing changes.', '2026-04-19T00:00:00.000', '2026-05-01T00:17:14.000', N'536994', NULL, NULL);
