First job it will be used on is over at the CU/FE Press to lower old plates down through bombay doors and then to hoist the new plates up and into place.', NULL, N'Problem was solved diligently and effectively.', N'Work Smarter, Not Harder', 0, NULL, N'REDUÇAO DE RISCO  A EPOSIÇÃO DE PESSOAS A PRODUTO QUIMICO', '2026-05-04T00:00:00.000', '2026-05-05T11:22:32.000', N'81031229', NULL, NULL);
