When we are running, there are times when the concentrate can get built up around the suction piping causing us to lose flow to the discharge pumps', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/11161.jpeg', N'a water lance was installed to help stir up the contents of the Ball Mill Discharge tank allow flow through the drain or flow to the suction piping of the discharge pumps. The Ball valve allows us to easily turn the water to the lance on and off without having to travel up to the second floor level.', NULL, N'we can quickly stir up solids in the bottom of the tank reducing down time or interruptions to production ', N'make small tasks easier ', 0, NULL, N'Improved operational continuity through stabilizing email notification service for Port Colborne OT operations staff', '2026-07-12T00:00:00.000', '2026-07-13T21:19:30.000', N'81045248', NULL, NULL);
