Based on estimated demand of 10 to 50 new coveralls per month and the reference cost of a size G coverall, annual purchase exposure is approximately $18,000 to $90,000. 
Project Goal: Create a clear and auditable procedure to standardize how employees request new uniforms and how those requests are reviewed, approved, and recorded. The goal is to build awareness and accountability among all stakeholders, verify available stock before purchase, confirm the operational need for each request, and reduce unnecessary or uncontrolled new uniform acquisitions.
', NULL, N'The initial goal directly addresses the problem by creating a formal process to control how new uniforms are requested, reviewed, approved, and recorded. By standardizing the acquisition process, Vale can reduce uncontrolled requests, improve visibility over real demand, verify available new or used stock before purchasing, and promote accountability among employees, supervisors, and the control owner. This alignment supports better cost control, reduces unnecessary purchases, and creates reliable data for future Procurement and Operations decisions.', N'Responsible use of materials can help reduce the company’s operating costs.', 2, 3, NULL, '2026-07-22T00:00:00.000', '2026-07-22T16:44:22.000', N'81058075', NULL, NULL);

Melhoria Implementada

Padronização do filtro UE610AP40Z para os comboios CA02, CV56 e CV58. 
Atualização das listas de tarefas 456038 (CA02) e BR903411 (CV56 e CV58) no SAP PM. 
Inclusão do novo material em contrato corporativo (GHT) por meio de processo ZCON. 
Revisão da periodicidade de manutenção do filtro torre de 500 horas para 1.000 horas, fundamentada em análise técnica', NULL, N' Substituição do componente ofensivo de custo

O filtro torre 13351854 (PN 400007141) foi substituído pelo 13044565 (PN UE610AP40Z) nos comboios CA02, CV56 e CV58.;egularização contratual

O novo filtro foi incluído em contrato por meio de processo ZCON, eliminando o problema de fornecimento e padronizando a aquisição do componente.;Correção dos planos SAP PM

As listas de tarefas 456038 (CA02) e BR903411 (CV56 e CV58) foram atualizadas, removendo a divergência entre o plano de manutenção e a solução adotada.;Redução da frequência de manutenção

A periodicidade do filtro torre passou de 500 h para 1.000 h, reduzindo a necessidade de intervenções preventivas. Sendo acompanhado a saturação do filtro e conforme condição , trocar por condição.', N'Redução significativa dos custos de manutenção associados aos filtros torre dos comboios diesel;Eliminação de um dos principais ofensores de custo identificado na frota;', 1, 1, N'Agora temos a possibilidade de limpar abaixo do armário', '2026-07-07T00:00:00.000', '2026-07-22T18:03:26.000', N'541850', NULL, NULL);
Eliminate rework and improve process efficiency by establishing a clear monthly invoice cut-off rule that reduces unnecessary accruals, improves period reporting accuracy, and avoids non-value-added steps such as accrual creation, approval, reversal, deletion, and invoice re-entry.
This low-cost improvement strengthens financial control, simplifies month-end activities, improves invoice processing reliability, and allows Contracts and Finance to focus on higher-value work through a more disciplined and consistent cut-off process.', NULL, N'The problem shows that the current accrual process creates multiple manual steps, increases exposure to inaccurate estimates, and delays invoice processing. By implementing a clear monthly invoice cut-off rule, the project supports the goal by reducing unnecessary accrual activity, simplifying the workflow, improving reporting accuracy, and allowing Contracts and Finance to focus on higher-value work.', N'By simplifying the workflow, Contracts and Finance can reduce manual effort, avoid repeated corrections, and focus more time on higher-value activities.', 0, NULL, N'Reduced image download delays and increased the time available for higher-value support work.', '2026-07-22T00:00:00.000', '2026-07-22T18:44:35.000', N'81058075', NULL, NULL);
