', NULL, N'Foi possível ampliar a faixa de frequência dos sensores de vibração de 34 Hz–13 kHz para  3 Hz–13 kHz, possibilitando a detecção de falhas associadas a vibrações de baixa frequência (3–34 Hz', N'Importância do monitoramento e configurações em casos especiais. ', 0, NULL, N'Contribuição para a conformidade com requisitos de segurança e ergonomia.', '2026-07-31T00:00:00.000', '2026-08-06T12:51:10.000', N'81041701', NULL, NULL);
Photo illustrates failed fixed bearing components.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/11615.jpeg', N'Runtime monitoring on generators to trigger greasing PM''s at 200h of runtime - based on bearing type and loading. 
SDT ultrasound sensors installed on horizontal unit bearings. Personnel now have the ability to listen to bearings during greasing and are notified by the handheld when ultrasonic amplitudes decrease to desirable levels.  
Improved greasing PM to utilize new equipment to support accurate greasing.
', NULL, N'Bearings are now accurately greased based on condition, opposed to previous practice of frequency-based PM''s. 
