By doing this the scale inhibitor will prevent scale growth on 3 of the other polish filter feed pump discharges, suction of all 4 pumps, the polish filter feed tank, equalization line to the flocculant dilution tank and flocculant dilution system.  

Average cost of line cleaning for pumps after looking through some workorders in SAP is $4200 not including any production losses and materials or labor required to reroute flows using chem hoses and AODD pumps. By sending the antiscalant through 4 pumps instead of 1 results in 3 less line cleaning activities a year, minimum savings $12,600.', NULL, N'Will need to gather data on required maintenance in future. ', N'optimize effectiveness of reagents to have greatest impact', 12600, 3, N'Simplificação dos planos preventivos, redução de reservas indevidas de materiais, diminuição de retrabalho administrativo, melhoria na qualidade das listas técnicas, maior assertividade do planejamento e melhor utilização dos recursos da manutenção.', '2026-08-30T00:00:00.000', '2026-08-31T01:59:17.000', N'1008382', NULL, NULL);
